# Local build outputs. A .vercelignore replaces .gitignore for uploads, so
# without these the CLI ships .next-check — the scratch dist the build:log
# gate writes — and Vercel then typechecks ITS generated route types. That is
# how a deploy of main came to fail on app/(ar)/banks types from a branch.
.next/
.next-check/
.next-build.log
node_modules/
